FTK (Forensic Toolkit) Lab Report
Overview

This repository contains a practical digital forensics lab assignment performed using FTK Imager. The project demonstrates the complete forensic investigation workflow, including evidence acquisition, analysis, forensic imaging, hash verification, and file recovery.

Tool Used
FTK Imager (Forensic Toolkit)
Digital Forensics Methodology
